<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts barley, corn tenders.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts barley, corn tenders.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Tuesday said it accepted a tender from Amiga International for 25,000 tonnes of barley at $141.90 per tonne and a tender from Toepfer for 18,000 tonnes of corn at 133.95.</p>
<p>The prices were C&amp;F, a statement from the grain commission said.</p>
<p>Scheduled shipment, according to the original invitation to tender, is July 1997.</p>
</text>
